    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d54">

                <pb facs="0088" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg78"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/3080: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-30T19:00:00-04:00">January 30, 1943—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>245. American interests France. Your 55, January 5.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d54-f1"
                    /> The Department contemplates no special arrangements for repatriation of
                    non-official Americans in the former unoccupied zone of France. However, should
                    any Americans in the former unoccupied zone obtain with or without Swiss
                    assistance exit permits for their individual travel to a neutral country en
                    route to the United States, Department would be pleased to be informed thereof
                    and would wish to be informed of their names.</p>
                <p>Lists of persons applying for repatriation as well as of those refusing
                    repatriation are of course desired because of their bearing upon question of
                    financial assistance to such individuals.</p>
                <p>You may inform Swiss of substance of foregoing in confidence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d54-f1" n="12" xml:id="d54-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it concerned inquiry by Swiss Legation, Vichy, with respect to
                    repatriation of non-official Americans from former unoccupied zone in
                    France.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
